  "description": "Yulha, abandoned by his former lover for being an inadequate omega, returns to his hometown for a fresh start.  \nAfter getting thoroughly drunk at a homecoming gathering and struggling with memories of an ex-lover, he ended up making a call to someone...\nWaking up with the horrifying memory of losing his reason during his very first heat cycle the night before, Yulha discovers an empty spot in the bed that still holds warmth—and a note promising a return:   \n\n*\"I’m going to take responsibility for you. Let’s get married.\"*  \n\nThe story of Dojin, who falls in love at first sight and proposes, and Yulha, whose heart is swayed by him.\n\nIf this isn't destiny, what is?\n\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Ifnotfate)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/Ifnotfate), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/Ifnotfate)",
